  "description": "Worker asset download operations: bounded transfers, queue pressure, cache reuse, byte progress, throughput, ETA and coalesced requests. All metrics use the static total label; asset/job/task identifiers remain out of Prometheus. Ready/failed/cache-hit and byte gauges describe the manager's retained transfer read model; active/queued/throughput/ETA describe current work.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "panels": [
